}}'''Palms (Knife)''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Summer Box]] during the [[Summer Event 2024]].                 It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade has a purple-to-yellow fade coloration, made to resemble a sunset, with three palms on it's base. The handle, on the other hand, is a mild purple with a darker fade towards the bottom.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Palms (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

